<title>USA: TABLE - Brightpoint Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Brightpoint Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21 proforma	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  4,867 proforma	 2,407</p>
<p> Revs		     220,027		  119,896</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,339		   20,895</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for Q2 1996 was $397,000 excluding one-time merger expenses and changes in income tax.</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.44		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			 10,283		    4,884</p>
<p> Revs		     419,196		  232,856</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,159		   20,809</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the first half of 1996 was $3.3 million, excluding one-time merger expenses and changes in income tax.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
